        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The professional sports leagues in which we operate, primarily the NBA and NHL, have the right under certain circumstances to regulate important aspects of our business, including, without limitation, our team-related online and mobile businesses.",
