        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The respective league constitutions of our sports teams, under which each league is operated, together with the collective bargaining agreements (each, a “CBA”) that each of the NBA and NHL has signed with its players’ association, contain numerous provisions that, as a practical matter, could impact the manner in which we operate our business.",
